{"overview":"طوفان برفی فاجعه‌بار که به سرعت شهر بوفالو را در برف و تاریکی غرق کرد، برق، گرما و دید را برای ساکنان محبوس در خانه و جاده‌ها قطع می‌کند؛ مدیر مک‌دونالدز برای ایجاد پناهگاهی موقت قوانین را زیر پا می‌گذارد، مردم فوراً برای نجات همسایگان خود اقدام می‌کنند و جامعه در شگفت‌انگیزترین جشن شب‌عید کریسمس متحد می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Follow the unfolding of a catastrophic blizzard that swiftly buried the city of Buffalo in snow and darkness, cutting power, heat, and visibility to residents trapped at home and on roads. A McDonald’s manager breaks protocol to create an impromptu refuge, people instantly mobilize to rescue their neighbors, and a community comes together in the most unexpected Christmas Eve celebration.","tagline_en":"A blizzard at its worst. Humanity at its best.","runtime":36,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Ben Proudfoot"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Jeffrey Spengler","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Paaché Spikes-Redding","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Jimmy Bessing","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Maria Alessi Bessing","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Tan Zhao","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Lili Zhao","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Lyndon Hayles","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Derek Westbrook","role":"Self","photo":""},{"name":"Thomas M. Brown","role":"Self","photo":""}],"trailer":"euNjKCj4Vi0","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1764131-the-buffalo-miracle/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"HBO Max","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/skypuy7SXuugIQeYg0IglmzoKaS.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1764131-the-buffalo-miracle/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"Now TV Cinema","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/hlfGtOZsbFw8jwVwDaFPUbaKgrq.png"},{"n":"HBO Max","kind":"flatrate",